      "text": "At any phase: return to an earlier phase · request a DIAN rejection\n(Rechazos DIAN → Rechazada DIAN) · close the invoice\n\nSLA per phase in business days (Colombian holidays);\na daily digest emails the owners of overdue invoices",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "notes",
      "originalText": "At any phase: return to an earlier phase · request a DIAN rejection\n(Rechazos DIAN → Rechazada DIAN) · close the invoice\n\nSLA per phase in business days (Colombian holidays);\na daily digest emails the owners of overdue invoices",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
